{"text":"kuruntokai","n":120,"lines":["இல்லோன் இன்பங் காமுற் றாஅங்கு","அரிதுவேட் டனையால் நெஞ்சே காதலி","நல்லள் ஆகுதல் அறிந்தாங்கு","அரியள் ஆகுதல் அறியா தோயே"],"tr":["illōṉ iṉpaṅ kāmuṟ ṟāaṅku","arituvēṭ ṭaṉaiyāl neñcē kātali","nallaḷ ākutal aṟintāṅku","ariyaḷ ākutal aṟiyā tōyē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"பரணர்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Paraṇar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 13, veṇcīr 2"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 11, kalittaḷai 2, veṇṭaḷai 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"இல்லோன்","tr":"illōṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இல்","tr":"il"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோன்","tr":"lōṉ"}]},{"text":"இன்பங்","tr":"iṉpaṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"இன்","tr":"iṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பங்","tr":"paṅ"}]},{"text":"காமுற்","tr":"kāmuṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"முற்","tr":"muṟ"}]},{"text":"றாஅங்கு","tr":"ṟāaṅku","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றா","tr":"ṟā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அங்","tr":"aṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]}],[{"text":"அரிதுவேட்","tr":"arituvēṭ","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரி","tr":"ari"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துவேட்","tr":"tuvēṭ"}]},{"text":"டனையால்","tr":"ṭaṉaiyāl","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டனை","tr":"ṭaṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யால்","tr":"yāl"}]},{"text":"நெஞ்சே","tr":"neñcē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நெஞ்","tr":"neñ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சே","tr":"cē"}]},{"text":"காதலி","tr":"kātali","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலி","tr":"tali"}]}],[{"text":"நல்லள்","tr":"nallaḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லள்","tr":"laḷ"}]},{"text":"ஆகுதல்","tr":"ākutal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குதல்","tr":"kutal"}]},{"text":"அறிந்தாங்கு","tr":"aṟintāṅku","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அறிந்","tr":"aṟin"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தாங்","tr":"tāṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]}],[{"text":"அரியள்","tr":"ariyaḷ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அரி","tr":"ari"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யள்","tr":"yaḷ"}]},{"text":"ஆகுதல்","tr":"ākutal","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆ","tr":"ā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குதல்","tr":"kutal"}]},{"text":"அறியா","tr":"aṟiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அறி","tr":"aṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"தோயே","tr":"tōyē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"இல்லோன்","parts":[{"text":"இல்லோன்","lemma":"இல்லோன்","gloss":"one who has nothing"}],"gloss":"poor man"},{"surface":"இன்பம்","parts":[{"text":"இன்பம்","lemma":"இன்பம்","gloss":"pleasure"}],"gloss":"pleasure"},{"surface":"காமுற்று","parts":[{"text":"காமுற்று","lemma":"காமுறு","gloss":"having desired"}],"gloss":"having desired"},{"surface":"ஆஅங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆஅங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"just like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரிது","parts":[{"text":"அரிது","lemma":"அரிது","gloss":"rare thing"}],"gloss":"difficult thing"},{"surface":"வேட்டனையால்","parts":[{"text":"வேட்டனை","lemma":"வேள்","gloss":"you desired"},{"text":"ஆல்","lemma":"ஆல்","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"you desired indeed"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சே","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"heart"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"O"}],"gloss":"O heart!"},{"surface":"காதலி","parts":[{"text":"காதலி","lemma":"காதலி","gloss":"beloved woman"}],"gloss":"the beloved"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்லள்","parts":[{"text":"நல்லள்","lemma":"நல்லள்","gloss":"good woman"}],"gloss":"she is good"},{"surface":"ஆகுதல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகுதல்","lemma":"ஆகுதல்","gloss":"being"}],"gloss":"her being"},{"surface":"அறிந்து","parts":[{"text":"அறிந்து","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"having known"}],"gloss":"having known"},{"surface":"ஆங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஆங்கு","lemma":"ஆங்கு","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"just as"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரியள்","parts":[{"text":"அரியள்","lemma":"அரியள்","gloss":"rare woman"}],"gloss":"she is difficult to attain"},{"surface":"ஆகுதல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆகுதல்","lemma":"ஆகுதல்","gloss":"being"}],"gloss":"her being"},{"surface":"அறியாதோயே","parts":[{"text":"அறியாதோய்","lemma":"அறியாதோன்","gloss":"you who do not know"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"O you who do not know!"}]}],"literal":"Like a poor man desiring pleasure, / you desired a difficult thing, O heart! The beloved, / just as you knew her being good, / you did not know her being difficult to attain!","translation":"Like a poor man who longs for pleasure, you have desired what is hard to attain, O my heart! Just as you knew that my beloved is good, you failed to know that she is hard to attain.","modern":"வறுமையுற்ற ஒருவன் இன்பத்தை விரும்பியது போல, என் நெஞ்சமே! நீ அடைவதற்கு அரியதை விரும்பினாய். என் காதலி நல்லவள் என்பதை அறிந்த நீ, அவள் அடைவதற்கு அரியவள் என்பதை அறியாமல் போய்விட்டாயே!","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the hero to his own heart in the Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape. Having fallen deeply in love with a mountain maiden, he realizes the immense difficulty of reaching her and winning her hand due to her family's strict guard. He compares his heart's desire to a poor man who yearns for pleasures he cannot afford. He chides his heart for readily recognizing how wonderful and good she is, while foolishly ignoring how unattainable she actually is. The key words are 'இல்லோன்' (poor man), 'அரிது' (difficult thing), and 'அறியாதோயே' (O you who do not know).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,2.08],[2.08,2.82],[2.82,3.4],[3.4,3.9],[3.9,4.4],[4.4,4.9],[4.9,5.4],[5.4,5.87],[5.87,6.44],[6.44,7.01],[7.01,7.44],[7.44,7.73]],"female":[[0.0,0.35],[0.35,0.7],[0.7,1.05],[1.28,1.8],[1.8,2.53],[2.6,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.6,4.0],[4.0,5.0],[5.0,5.5],[5.5,5.73],[5.73,6.25],[6.25,6.78],[6.78,7.17],[7.17,7.45]]},"sync":[[["இல்லோன்","poor man"]],[["இன்பம்","pleasure"]],[["காமுற்று","having desired"]],[["காமுற்று","having desired"],["ஆஅங்கு","just like"]],[["அரிது","difficult thing"],["வேட்டனையால்","you desired indeed"]],[["வேட்டனையால்","you desired indeed"]],[["நெஞ்சே","O heart!"]],[["காதலி","the beloved"]],[["நல்லள்","she is good"]],[["ஆகுதல்","her being"]],[["அறிந்து","having known"],["ஆங்கு","just as"]],[["அரியள்","she is difficult to attain"]],[["ஆகுதல்","her being"]],[["அறியாதோயே","O you who do not know!"]],[["அறியாதோயே","O you who do not know!"]]]}